      "writtenOn": "2022-05-02T00:43:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We seem to have code like this all over the place. (In fact, there are two just in this CL.)\n\nCan we aadd a utility method for this somewhere in frameworks/libs/net? It looks like such a method would need to only take the string name, the header line (here, \"BPF ingress map: iif nat64Prefix v6Addr -\u003e v4Addr oif\"), a lambda that knows how to dump each line, and the PrintWriter.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 752,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 757,
        "endChar": 32
      },
      "revId": "707675511a321fbdf4c9faea5c3c11b60d35d539",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "79d1053b_415c9e93",
